## Decision

What was decided and WHY. Not just "we chose A" but "we chose A because [specific reasoning
that helps future readers understand trade-offs]."

Record each citable decision using an accepted form. Preferred form: a numbered list, because it
creates a stable citation id: `1. **Decision summary.** Rationale.` Accepted alternatives are a
bold D-heading (`**D1 — Decision summary.**`) or an ATX D-heading (`### D1 — Decision summary`).

